      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VINCENZO (1) has been racing well from wide barriers of late, drawing deepest and racing three wide without cover before fighting on well to place here last week. Ticking along well and is much better served by the ace draw so can break through. Manners let ROCKNROLL COWBOY (7) down last week but he had been going very well prior, kicking off his campaign with back-to-back wins at this circuit and distance. If on his game he can bounce back. KEAYANG VIPER (5) is a progressive Victorian mare who took her record to five from seven when scoring at Terang last start. Has the pace to push forward so could measure up. MAC BON (4) has been coming from wider barriers of late and did manage a fourth over this distance two back. A better draw gives him the chance to find his best. MCWIZARD (6) can feature again after placing from a similar draw last week.",
